    "bodySample": "‹‹ SALES ▾ FUNDING ▾ CLIENT OPS ▾ WATCH ▾ AUTOMATION ▾ ◈ Agent Editor BETA ⇄ Workflows ⇝ Journeys BETA ✎ Message Copy MARKETING ▾ ADMIN ▾ PORTALS ▾ fundhub Beta — under development. Data may be incomplete or inaccurate. Do not use for client decisions. Dismiss fundhub JOURNEYS UNDO SAVE VERSION TEST AGAINST THE CODE APPLY TO CODE JOURNEYS Client 13 Setter 6 Closer 9 Funding Advisor 5 Affiliate 3 White-Label Partner 3 JOURNEY Client What a business owner goes through, from filling out the form to getting their result. CHANGES THIS JOURNEY MAKE THE CHANGE If they don’t confirm by 6pm, text them again at 8am Add a 3-day check-in after the call Email a recap once the diagnostic is done STARTS WHEN Someone submits the funding form + Text them the survey link SEND A TEXT Hi {{first_name}} — Chris from Fundhub. Got your request. Quick 2-min survey so I can see what you'd qualify for: {{survey_link}} Reply STOP to opt out. + Give the lead to a setter ASSIGN TO Goes to whichever Setter is available + Wait two days for the survey WAIT Nothing happens for 2 days + Did they finish the survey ASK A QUESTION Two paths below, depending on the answer YES NO + Move them to Survey Complete MOVE THE CARD Their card moves to Survey Complete in Sales + Text them the booking link SEND A TEXT Thanks {{first_name}}. Based on what you shared there's a path here. Grab a time and I'll walk you through it: {{booking_link}} Reply STOP to opt out. + + + Nudge them once more SEND A TEXT {{first_name}} — still need those 2 minutes to see what you qualify for: {{survey_link}} Reply STOP to opt out. + + + Move them to Booked MOVE THE CARD Their card moves to Booked in Sales + Remind them the day before SEND A TEXT {{first_name}} — we're on for tomorrow at {{time}}. Bring your entity info and I'll map out what's available. Reply STOP to opt out. + Hand the call to a closer HAND OFF The Closer journey picks up at Call Assigned + Take the $32 diagnostic TAKE PAYMENT Charge $32.00 for Business Financial Assessment + Run UnderwriteIQ RUN AN AGENT Soft pull, then score the file and pick a route. + Email the results SEND AN EMAIL Your Fundhub diagnostic is ready — {{first_name}} — your report is in the portal: {{portal_link}}. Your advisor will call to walk through it. + ENDS WHEN They have their diagnostic — funding takes over STEP SIMULATE HISTORY NOTHING SELECTED Type what you want changed in the box on the canvas and it gets built — copy written, timing set, wired in. Or click any step to change it by hand, and use + on the line between steps to add one. TEST — Owner Role · owner · 34 tabs LIVE Sign out Search ⌘K Chat"
